{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evenfall is an upcoming point-and-click visual novel by Niv, with music by turingsghost. The game is still in development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras/a97661ef07a5ed2a2aaca03c2d7302ee.avif?t=1755816318\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras_big/a97661ef07a5ed2a2aaca03c2d7302ee.webp?t=1755816318 width=1600 height=402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evenfall is known as the city of eternal sunset\u2014an ex-mining colony where the sun hangs motionless below the horizon. One day, all of its outgoing communication goes dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intrepid technician Indigo is sent to diagnose the issue. The first thing they discover? Evenfall is\u00a0<i>teeming</i>\u00a0with robots. Not that they're complaining; they've always preferred the company of machines over their fellow humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with megacorporate support dwindling, Evenfall is on the brink of collapse. As Indigo digs into the city's secrets, they uncover a conspiracy that might finally spell an end to the twilit metropolis\u2014with Indigo caught in the middle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras/6ce0c27a03017e0045edd4ea09d6809a.avif?t=1755816318\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949990/extras_big/6ce0c27a03017e0045edd4ea09d6809a.webp?t=1755816318 width=1600 height=402 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THERE ARE CUTE ROBOTS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt; TAZ</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you 